#. module: om_account_followup
#: model:mail.template,body_html:om_account_followup.email_template_om_account_followup_level1
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: 'Lucica Grande', Ubuntu, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); \">\n"
"    \n"
"    <p>Dear <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"   <p>\n"
"    We are disappointed to see that despite sending a reminder, that your account is now seriously overdue.\n"
"It is essential that immediate payment is made, otherwise we will have to consider placing a stop on your account\n"
"which means that we will no longer be able to supply your company with (goods/services).\n"
"Please, take appropriate measures in order to carry out this payment in the next 8 days.\n"
"If there is a problem with paying invoice that we are not aware of, do not hesitate to contact our accounting\n"
"department. so that we can resolve the matter quickly.\n"
"Details of due payments is printed below.\n"
" </p>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"Best Regards,\n"
"    \n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<t t-out=\"user.name\"/>\n"
"    \n"
"<br/>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"\n"
"<t t-out=\"object.get_followup_table_html()\"/>\n"
"\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: 'Lucica Grande', Ubuntu, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); \">\n"
"    <p>Estimado(a) <t t-out=\"object.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"    <p>Lamentamos constatar que, a pesar del recordatorio enviado, su cuenta presenta un atraso considerable.</p>\n"
"    <p>Es indispensable que el pago se realice de inmediato; de lo contrario, nos veremos en la necesidad de suspender su cuenta, lo que implica que no podremos continuar suministrando bienes o servicios a su empresa.</p>\n"
"    <p>Le agradecemos tomar las medidas necesarias para realizar este pago en los próximos 8 días.</p>\n"
"    <p>Si existe algún inconveniente con el pago de las facturas del que no tengamos conocimiento, no dude en comunicarse con nuestro departamento de contabilidad para resolverlo a la mayor brevedad.</p>\n"
"    <p>A continuación encontrará el detalle de los pagos vencidos.</p>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    Cordialmente,\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"user.name\"/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"    <t t-out=\"object.get_followup_table_html()\"/>\n"
"    <br/>\n"
"</div>\n"

